onials_f6EP9P":{"type":"product-testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials_MfRQPz":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.26_AM.jpg","description":"<p>Absolutely love my ring! It came exactly as pictured & described. It is very well crafted & beautiful. The sizing is perfect and the seller was very prompt and friendly to work with. They asked great questions to make sure it was done right and I’m so pleased. I would highly recommend them and will certainly buy from them again in the future!<\/p>","text_name":"Kristen","product_item":""}},"testimonials_D9wmJF":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.26_AM_1.jpg","description":"<p>Beautiful ring. Looks great with my engagement ring. It arrived earlier than expected.<\/p>","text_name":"Melanie","product_item":""}},"testimonials_HcatVH":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.26_AM_2.jpg","description":"<p>Thank you, gorgeous and very unique ring, will be back for more<\/p>","text_name":"Mary","product_item":""}},"testimonials_NkJic9":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.26_AM_3.jpg","description":"<p>Excellent . Beautifully made. Also freya was brilliant at communicating even had a problems with the delivery people but thats a joke here in the uk sometimes but we overcame the problem nothing to do with the seller or product but i was reasured and she delt with the hickup amazingly . I hope to give this to my future wife.<\/p>","text_name":"Gary","product_item":""}},"testimonials_LqqWAJ":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.26_AM_4.jpg","description":"<p>Love it! It came quickly and freya was very responsive.<\/p>","text_name":"Brenna Lemon","product_item":""}},"testimonials_YKHcCV":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.27_AM.jpg","description":"<p>I ordered this as my wedding band and it’s so cute and dainty. The seller was amazing at communicating with me, showing me the mock up of the design before it was made and sending me a picture of it after it was completed and before it was shipped. Size was a perfect match compared to my engagement ring as well. Thank you GemRoyals!<\/p>","text_name":"Jill","product_item":""}},"testimonials_mr8L4A":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.27_AM_1.jpg","description":"<p>Absolutely amazing quality and service! Freya provided excellent service on my request for an extended length. Very courteous, meticulous, and quick responses. LOVE LOVE LOVE this piece!!! Shipping was quick with lots of tracking updates. Thank you 😊 I couldn't be happier!<\/p>","text_name":"Janet","product_item":""}},"testimonials_pYj3fy":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.27_AM_2.jpg","description":"<p>This ring is beautiful! The stones are well cut and the ring is well designed. I purchased this ring for 2 reasons: I wanted a high-quality ring that could hold its own being worn with my real diamond ring and also wanted a band that I could wear while traveling so I can leave my real diamonds at home. This ring delivered! The customer service was great-informative and communicative every step of the way. I highly recommend!<\/p>","text_name":"Jamie DiCaterino","product_item":""}},"testimonials_yMQmLz":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.27_AM_3.jpg","description":"<p>This ring exceeded my expectations! So pretty and goes well with my engagement ring ❤️ I had to exchange for a slightly larger size; the seller was quick and helpful sorting that out for me.<\/p>","text_name":"Bri","product_item":""}},"testimonials_FrrrYh":{"type":"testimonials","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/WhatsApp_Image_2025-10-17_at_10.18.27_AM_4.jpg","description":"<p>My ring is so beautiful! It sparkles so brilliantly. Honestly, it's prettier than the picture! It fits perfectly, and the engraving is nice and clear, which I was worried about since I needed quite a small size. Freya was very helpful and made sure to check on details we had mistakenly neglected to include when ordering. You won't regret ordering from this shop!<\/p>","text_name":"Gretchen","product_item":""}}},"block_order":["testimonials_MfRQPz","testimonials_D9wmJF","testimonials_HcatVH","testimonials_NkJic9","testimonials_LqqWAJ","testimonials_YKHcCV","testimonials_mr8L4A","testimonials_pYj3fy","testimonials_yMQmLz","testimonials_FrrrYh"],"name":"t:sections.testimonials_product.name","settings":{"heading":"Customer Say!","heading_border":false,"description":"","text_align":"text-center","container":"container-fluid","color_scheme":"","show_rating":true,"show_image":true,"show_verified":true,"img_view":"framed","img_position":"position-left","aspect_ratio":"3\/4","custom_ratio":"21:9","content_width":50,"car_gap":30,"carousel_item_desktop":2,"autoplay":true,"loop":true,"show_arrow":true,"reveal_on_scroll":false,"carousel_pagination":"carousel_none","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"reset_spacing":false}},"instagram_VcJwMB":{"type":"instagram","blocks":{"ig_img_local_8aqQai":{"type":"ig_img_local","settings":{"ig_up_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Moss_Agate_Engagement_Ring_Hexagon_Cut_-_14K_Gold_Green_Gemstone_Ring_with_Marquise_Diamonds_-_U.jpg","ig_link":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DM7IxpghoMW\/?img_index=1"}},"ig_img_local_x3gXGi":{"type":"ig_img_local","settings":{"ig_up_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/DSC04324.jpg","ig_link":"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/p\/DPYknGEgVZn\/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link&igsh=MzRlODBiNWFlZA=="}},"ig_img_local_gKr4Yr":{"type":"ig_img_local","settings":{"ig_up_image